      detail: `Learn's Create assignmentPolicies page, example 3, gives the request: POST /identityGovernance/entitlementManagement/assignmentPolicies with allowedTargetScope specificDirectoryUsers, an attributeRuleMembers target holding the rule, automaticRequestSettings and the access package, with EntitlementManagement.ReadWrite.All. accessPackageAutomaticRequestSettings has three properties: requestAccessForAllowedTargets, removeAccessWhenTargetLeavesAllowedTargets and gracePeriodBeforeAccessRemoval. For request policies, requestorManager makes the requester's manager the approver, and Learn says to include another approver in case the requester has no manager.`,
