      detail: `You need Python 3.10 or later. Work in examples/hr-lifecycle. Step 1, list the reads and their permissions: python python/graph_export.py --task access-read --list prints Task access-read: EntitlementManagement.Read.All, User.Read.All; GET /identityGovernance/entitlementManagement/assignmentPolicies [EntitlementManagement.Read.All]; GET /identityGovernance/entitlementManagement/assignments [EntitlementManagement.Read.All]; GET /users/{userId}/transitiveMemberOf/microsoft.graph.group [User.Read.All]. Step 2, lint the program's policies over the population: python python/access_assignment.py lint config/access --population tests/fixtures/ch04/population.json gives Policies: 3 files; Lint: 0 Finding, 0 Warn, 0 Info.`,
