      say: `Step four scans an export of the tenant's policies: four read, one uses member-of, the legacy shared drives policy. Learn's own script runs the same test against a tenant; this one runs in the pipeline. Step five lists a mover's residual. Jordan moved from ORG-100 to ORG-210 on October nineteenth: eight items held, three go to review. A requested package and two groups granted outside any package land on the sheet for the manager. The one finding: the review is still open thirteen days after the move. Step six: fifty-seven tests pass.`,
      detail: `Step 4, scan the tenant's policies for memberOf: python python/access_assignment.py memberof-scan --policies tests/fixtures/ch04/assignment-policies.json gives Assignment policies read: 4; using memberOf: 1; MS-01 Finding: Shared drives (legacy): AUTO via group membership. Learn publishes its own script for the same test, which runs against a tenant (Lab 2 runs both); this scan is the same test in the pipeline, over the export graph_export.py writes. Step 5, list a mover's residual: python python/access_assignment.py residual --mover tests/fixtures/ch04/mover.json --assignments tests/fixtures/ch04/mover-assignments.json --memberships tests/fixtures/ch04/mover-memberships.json --policies config/access --as-of 2026-11-01T12:00:00Z --cloud gcc --out out/ch04/residual gives Mover jordan.diaz@contoso.example: 8 items held, 3 to the residual review; Residual: 1 Finding, 3 Warn, 0 Info. Jordan moved from ORG-100 to ORG-210 on October 19. residual.json shows the Program Operations baseline removed by rule after grace on October 26, the Infrastructure Services baseline kept by rule, the two packages' app groups package-managed and the ORG-210 dynamic group rule-managed. The review sheet holds the other three: Grants reporting workspace (requested: review), APP-Legacy-Timekeeping-Approvers and SHARE-ProgramOps-Finance (outside packages: review). The Finding is RV-02: the review is still open 13 days after the move, past the program's ten. Step 6: python -m pytest tests -q gives 57 passed. Delete out/ch04 when you're done. The slide omits the long residual command line and the exit-code lines (the scan and the residual both exit 2).`,
